+// ===========================================================================
+// #321 A16-threading Phase 3 (B1) — pre-RA Ac16 residency [SPIKE, flag-gated].
+//
+// threadAccum16 (above) collapses a redundant `STAImag16 R; LDAImag16 R` round-
